{"title": "第四章", "index": 1430, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IBEQG0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">道冲而用之或不盈，渊兮似万物之宗。挫其锐，解其纷，和其光，同其尘。湛兮似或存，吾不知谁之子，象帝之先。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}